===========================================================================
DCE Threads Compatibility Library for Linux
A DCE Threads emulation layer ontop of LinuxThreads.
===========================================================================
Maintainers:	Miroslaw Dobrzanski-Neumann <mirek-dn@freenet.de>	
		Wez Furlong                 <wez+dce@thebrainroom.com>

This packages no longer implements pthreads draft 4.
Instead, it purely implements dce threading exceptions.

For information about copyrights, see the file `COPYING' included with this
package.

SEE: https://www0.mi.infn.it/~calcolo/OpenVMS/ssb71/6493/6493p001.htm
